    """Inline a top‑level $ref into the root schema.

    If the schema contains a $ref that points into $defs, replace the root with the referenced
    definition and keep the remaining siblings. If the $defs dictionary is missing or does not
    contain the referenced definition, emit a warning and return the original schema unchanged.
    """
